      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Tu-whit, tu-whoo!",
      "output_sha256": "bc37498a70f9e464879f794477ad5240526cea3551513cfe479e6ae6d0a059dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc37498a70f9e464879f794477ad5240526cea3551513cfe479e6ae6d0a059dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We're slackers and laggards, and the Germans are overwhelming us.",
      "output_sha256": "1beb16a4daac080ae93af51e6f6c4d5661df16c738586f1146ef1d075eed979b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.677273,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        70
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e5a71e6ab3bf483c2a39f36f1619b401a69c8d237376ff94f7595659fb0484a3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1beb16a4daac080ae93af51e6f6c4d5661df16c738586f1146ef1d075eed979b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Tu-whit, tu-whoo.",
      "output_sha256": "6577527ca295eb03223413fae5efa3d37b248f780c97237c7ee9cac8a41f82a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "6577527ca295eb03223413fae5efa3d37b248f780c97237c7ee9cac8a41f82a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They're on the way to India and Egypt, and nothing will stop them.",
      "output_sha256": "2ef74e9e0564c321f3e15a9b89f25977cb895d2009ab788abb152f44005c636a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ef74e9e0564c321f3e15a9b89f25977cb895d2009ab788abb152f44005c636a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "All hope is lost.\"",
      "output_sha256": "f4998bae49f87a98ee4fec5effd009ba6b1ced015f61c057e5e277d7d63787c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": 0.7875,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "69cc47821f7e5329a656a2142496dce611f910fee5ca9256c2fb53135fce13bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f4998bae49f87a98ee4fec5effd009ba6b1ced015f61c057e5e277d7d63787c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I notice that they enjoy a beef-steak as much as anybody, and do not refuse their soup though they salt it with their tears.",
      "output_sha256": "04c2562326095efd0c470641ddab9af6500356904cfa247c6d10474a9629b2a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "04c2562326095efd0c470641ddab9af6500356904cfa247c6d10474a9629b2a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I find the anecdote about Stonewall Jackson and the owl particularly telling.",
      "output_sha256": "f41ea6a6b1ecf363b8878d698a097ee9cc960cd99d7107039b5abce4d7856c96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": 0.552121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62763c9dd104610cbfff690db962716e6a69055d84d49455f4eda8e0e5f7bd95"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f41ea6a6b1ecf363b8878d698a097ee9cc960cd99d7107039b5abce4d7856c96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The owl was a general, and he rushed up to Jackson in the crisis of the first battle of Bull's Run, crying \"All is lost!",
      "output_sha256": "abe9bdef864c0e1999f19c77fe85b71a408040900af6031c3518096396e00826",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "abe9bdef864c0e1999f19c77fe85b71a408040900af6031c3518096396e00826",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We're beaten!\"",
      "output_sha256": "b15dbb259f003920ef90ec8386b98430f367d767c0152aa937592501c2d2bd3a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "b15dbb259f003920ef90ec8386b98430f367d767c0152aa937592501c2d2bd3a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Oh,\" said Jackson, \"if that's so I'd advise you to keep it to yourself.\"",
      "output_sha256": "44afbce24a694cf5e02bd47c014d0eaea808d240b010bb908fff70dc4482cbff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "44afbce24a694cf5e02bd47c014d0eaea808d240b010bb908fff70dc4482cbff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A half-hour later, Jackson's brigade made a charge that turned the tide of the battle.",
      "output_sha256": "5302d0a0d65e30a4912fa9644b7d9958485182b7e38dbea68bc413011cd6a4ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.481107,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        79
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "59a17cc718cc8ab49d418579eaa9536bfc5a175ce5360431ab13f2912c498056"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5302d0a0d65e30a4912fa9644b7d9958485182b7e38dbea68bc413011cd6a4ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I can only wonder what became of the owl, but I suspect he continued to lament, \"Tu-whit-ing\" and \"Tu-whoo-ing\" until the very end.",
      "output_sha256": "f2524f8439656fc23d06f5165323fe6c123dbaf35105f2f072b287d384e22203",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": 0.557011,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        80
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "666933330c9cc2d0f48362cb553d2bdaf2bdae829f1afe81c6693d4991554f6b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2524f8439656fc23d06f5165323fe6c123dbaf35105f2f072b287d384e22203",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        74
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The owl can't help being an owl.",
      "output_sha256": "e40f600e661f631906da67fa27ead72756899b80a9a4c1e0f65b8723e04d1139",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "e40f600e661f631906da67fa27ead72756899b80a9a4c1e0f65b8723e04d1139",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ah, there is little red waistcoat singing on the fence.",
      "output_sha256": "703141dceabfdeb7d2b2a45377c248d6c24e6799dc7f79faa923df8ad092eb99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 82,
      "source_human_sha256": "703141dceabfdeb7d2b2a45377c248d6c24e6799dc7f79faa923df8ad092eb99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let’s find him a worm, shall we?",
      "output_sha256": "048835ad1dcc39314416461f4085264c3661293b1da50a13240f04412aae580e",
